        "product_summary": "Seasonal high-top silhouette: A raised collar and plush lining give this lace-up shoe a clear cold-season casual appearance.\n\nAdjustable lace front: Metal-look eyelets and a raised tongue define the instep fastening across both colour options.\n\nApron toe stitching: A curved seam outlines the forefoot above the continuous wraparound sole sidewall.\n\nVisible entry details: Original close photographs show the plush collar texture and rear pull loop for handling the shoe when putting it on.\n\nTwo colour directions: Black offers a tonal profile, while Khaki pairs a tan upper with light-coloured lining. Both are listed in EU39-46 for wholesale colour-size assortments.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
